WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.490
- [Narrator] The first sandwich in history

00:00:01.490 --> 00:00:03.590
was thought to be created by Rabbi Hillel,

00:00:03.920 --> 00:00:05.660
who made this meal for Passover.

00:00:05.660 --> 00:00:08.040
- You've got apple and horseradish,

00:00:08.040 --> 00:00:11.450
which I know sounds disgusting,
but it somehow works.

00:00:11.450 --> 00:00:14.370
- [Narrator] But this meal
wasn't known as sandwich

00:00:14.370 --> 00:00:17.215
until John Montagu the
fourth Earl of Sandwich

00:00:17.215 --> 00:00:19.290
came along in the 18th century.

00:00:19.290 --> 00:00:20.630
- I am John Montagu

00:00:21.371 --> 00:00:25.123
and I invented the
sandwich not you Subway!

00:00:25.460 --> 00:00:26.837
You owe me money!

00:00:27.410 --> 00:00:29.070
- [Narrator] Our legendary tale begins

00:00:29.070 --> 00:00:30.660
in 18th century England

00:00:30.770 --> 00:00:33.943
where Montagu was on a
24 hour gambling bender.

00:00:34.327 --> 00:00:35.478
(dramatic music)

00:00:35.478 --> 00:00:37.820
- Losers, losers, I'm the winner.

00:00:37.910 --> 00:00:40.570
- Hey guys, here's your
meat, hope you enjoy it.

00:00:40.570 --> 00:00:41.700
- [Narrator] Montagu did not like any

00:00:41.700 --> 00:00:43.263
interruptions while gambling.

00:00:45.780 --> 00:00:49.283
It's possible that his
impatience led to his invention.

00:00:49.480 --> 00:00:51.220
- Come on deal the next hand.

00:00:51.220 --> 00:00:52.973
- I am eating, you old chump.

00:00:53.250 --> 00:00:54.630
- There, do give us a minute.

00:00:54.630 --> 00:00:56.293
- I want to win my money back.

00:00:56.466 --> 00:00:59.710
(speaking in foreign language)

00:00:59.710 --> 00:01:00.780
- [Narrator] The story suggests

00:01:00.780 --> 00:01:03.040
that eating and gambling at the same time

00:01:03.130 --> 00:01:05.010
did not happen in Montagu's world.

00:01:05.010 --> 00:01:07.380
This could be because player's
hands were busy dealing

00:01:07.380 --> 00:01:08.590
with a fork and a knife

00:01:08.590 --> 00:01:10.130
or if they ate with their hands

00:01:10.130 --> 00:01:11.780
they would get their cards dirty.

00:01:12.930 --> 00:01:13.763
- Disgusting.

00:01:13.929 --> 00:01:14.762
(claps)

00:01:14.762 --> 00:01:15.730
- Hey guys, what can I get ya?

00:01:15.730 --> 00:01:18.813
- I want roast beef between
two pieces of bread.

00:01:18.970 --> 00:01:19.803
Now go.

00:01:19.803 --> 00:01:23.080
- [Narrator] Roast beef between
two slices of toasted bread

00:01:23.090 --> 00:01:26.313
would be the official first sandwich.

00:01:26.620 --> 00:01:29.820
- Hello, I want you to try my sandwich.

00:01:29.820 --> 00:01:30.653
- OK.

00:01:35.680 --> 00:01:36.513
- No.

00:01:36.513 --> 00:01:37.370
- [Narrator] It was amazing.

00:01:37.370 --> 00:01:39.510
Montagu can now hold the food in one hand

00:01:39.540 --> 00:01:41.040
while gambling with the other.

00:01:47.920 --> 00:01:49.457
Which led everybody to say,

00:01:49.457 --> 00:01:51.360
"Hey, I'll have the same as Sandwich."

00:01:51.360 --> 00:01:53.050
And the story goes that this is how

00:01:53.050 --> 00:01:54.690
the lunch time favorite got it's name

00:01:54.690 --> 00:01:58.033
and why we continue to refer
to this meal as sandwich.

